Package: xr-monado-steamvr-driver
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Independent Qiyu SteamVR provider
 Independently maintained XR component for openKylin integration.

Package: xr-native-interop
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Explicit app scoped Vulkan and OpenXR compatibility layers
 Provides the independently built shared-image and lifecycle adaptations.
 Activation is per application; installation does not enable global layers.

Package: xr-runtime-passthrough
Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: XROS OpenXR runtime camera environment blending
 Provides explicit Vulkan2 stereo passthrough from the existing device owner.
 Applications use OpenXR alpha environment blending without camera access code.
 Installation does not activate the layer or change camera ownership.
